  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This programme provides core funding for the activities of the Kenyan Human Rights Comission (KHRC), The organization&apos;s mission is to foster human rights, democratic values, human dignity and social justice locally, nationally and internationally. Their strategic objectives are to strenghten civil and political rights, economic and social rights, equality and non-discrimination, and institutional development and sustainability.</narrative>
